{"data":{"target":{"id":"ENSG00000136531","approvedSymbol":"SCN2A","functionDescriptions":["Mediates the voltage-dependent sodium ion permeability of excitable membranes. Assuming opened or closed conformations in response to the voltage difference across the membrane, the protein forms a sodium-selective channel through which Na(+) ions may pass in accordance with their electrochemical gradient (PubMed:1325650, PubMed:17021166, PubMed:28256214, PubMed:29844171). Implicated in the regulation of hippocampal replay occurring within sharp wave ripples (SPW-R) important for memory (By similarity). {ECO:0000250|UniProtKB:B1AWN6, ECO:0000269|PubMed:1325650, ECO:0000269|PubMed:17021166, ECO:0000269|PubMed:28256214, ECO:0000269|PubMed:29844171}."],"proteinIds":[{"id":"Q99250","source":"uniprot_swissprot"},{"id":"A0A0D9SGG2","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"A0A1B0GTS6","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"A0A1B0GTX0","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"A0A1B0GW40","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"A0A1B0GW67","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"A0A1B0GWA6","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"A0A669KAR0","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"A0A669KBL5","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"A0A669KBM3","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"F6U291","source":"uniprot_trembl"},{"id":"ENSP00000283256","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000364586","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000406454","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000486885","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000487466","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000489821","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000489873","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000490107","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000490592","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000490765","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000490800","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000490849","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000490866","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000500975","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP00000501305","source":"ensembl_PRO"},{"id":"ENSP0000